<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - April 4.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - April 4.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Alcoa is expected to report first quarter earnings per share of $0.90, down from $1.01 a year earlier, according to First Call. The stock closed at 67-1/2 Thursday.</p>
<p>* Shares of Philip Morris Cos Inc were down 3/8 at 114 in London.  </p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1737))</p>
